---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section labelledby="why-title">
  {/* Script pull-quote over dense two-column body copy, the way the reference
      ad sets its sell paragraph beneath the headline. */}
  <p
    id="why-title"
    class="neon max-w-[22ch] font-script text-3xl text-balance [--tube:var(--color-signal)] sm:max-w-[30ch] sm:text-4xl"
  >
    a fresh challenge in hardware
  </p>

  <div
    class="mt-8 border-t-2 border-phosphor/20 pt-8 text-base text-pretty text-phosphor-dim sm:columns-2 sm:gap-12 sm:text-sm"
  >
    <p>
      Mint is a short break from the big projects everyone&rsquo;s been slaving
      away on. Most people lately have gravitated toward big, extravagant
      builds. Those can wear on you mentally.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Mint is a lower-stakes, lower-hour-count alternative &mdash; something a
      beginner or an advanced builder can pick up, finish, and actually feel
      good about shipping in a short amount of time.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
